---
import TextPage from '../components/TextPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<TextPage
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`What information ${SITE.domain} collects, how we use it, and how to ask us to change or remove it.`}
  path="/privacy/"
  updated="15 October 2026"
>
  <h2>The short version</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You don't need an account to use this site, and we don't ask for your personal details to browse it.</li>
    <li>We don't use advertising trackers or analytics cookies.</li>
    <li>When you call or WhatsApp a business from a listing, you are contacting them directly. We don't see or record that conversation.</li>
    <li>Business owners can ask us to correct or remove their listing at any time.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <h3>When you visit the site</h3>
  <p>
    The site is hosted on Cloudflare, which processes basic technical information such as your IP address, browser
    type and the pages requested, to deliver the site and protect it from abuse. Our fonts are loaded from Google Fonts,
    so Google also receives your IP address and browser details when a page loads. See
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a> and
    <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google's privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h3>When you email us or submit a listing</h3>
  <p>
    The "List your business" form opens your own email app; nothing is stored on our site. When you email us we receive
    what you send, such as your name, business name, phone number and email address. We use it only to reply to you
    and to create or update your listing.
  </p>

  <h3>Business listings</h3>
  <p>
    Listings contain business information: name, phone and WhatsApp number, address, opening hours, services and a short
    description. We compile this from information businesses publish themselves (for example on their signboards,
    websites and map listings) and from what owners tell us. Listings marked "Verified" have been confirmed with the
    business. We don't list home addresses or personal details that a business hasn't made public.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To show business listings so people in Belagavi can contact them.</li>
    <li>To reply to messages, process listing requests and arrange featured listings.</li>
    <li>To keep the site secure and working.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We don't sell or rent personal information, and we don't share it with anyone except the service providers above.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    If your business is listed and you want to correct, update or remove it, or you want us to delete emails you've sent
    us, write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>. We'll act on the request within 7
    working days. Pages can take a few more days to drop out of search engines after we remove them.
  </p>

  <h2>Grievance contact</h2>
  <p>
    For any concern about how we handle personal data, including under India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023,
    contact us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>If we change how we handle information, we'll update this page and the date at the top.</p>
</TextPage>
